OL,3,GNEWSANew rain warning issued for
OL,4,AEngland and Wales as Storm Boelo hits
OL,5,AUK
OL,6,
OL,7,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,8,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,9,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,10,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,12,FOn Friday, Austen hit southern England,
OL,13,Fthe Channel Islands, and parts of Wales
OL,15,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,16,Fpower in south-west England - thousands
OL,17,Fare still waiting to be reconnected on
OL,18,FSaturday
